Together with~\eqref{eq:St e bound}, this implies that $|\phi_{t+1}^{-1}(v_i)\cap N_{\cH}(\cX_{t+1}\sm\cX_{t+1}^{\phi_{t+1}})|\leq \eps_{c(t+1)}^{1/2}{n}.$
