The paper’s native witness is a packing: one bijection per guest graph into a multipartite host, checked only by injectivity and exact edge membership. The theorem is existential and its proof constructs the packing through pseudorandom hypergraph matchings followed by ordinary blow-up-lemma completions; I’m now checking whether that route yields a defensible hardness track or merely a polynomial certificate algorithm.
