\omega_{v_{i}}(M)&
\stackrel{\ref{emb lem:vertex testers}}{=}
(1\pm\eps_{c(t+1)})\frac{\omega_{v_{i}}(E(\sA_{t+1}))}{\alpha_Ad_A^{m_{t+1}(t)}n}\pm \eps_{c(t+1)}n
