codex
The module is implemented in the paper’s native graph-packing language. It inverse-generates planted and unused matching factors exchangeably, exposes only the bipartite host, accepts any valid normalized packing, and includes the polynomial reference solver separately from four failing no-tool attacks. I’m running the full 200,000-sample and relabelling audits now.
