The required harness is externally blocked: OpenRouter returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded (total limit)” on every retry before any model inference. Those are service errors, not model failures, so I will not claim the family hardened. I’ll preserve that harness-owned evidence, run the two G9 arms in isolated directories to document the same limitation, and finish the locally verified module and README with the blocker stated plainly.
