+Row h is [p_h[0],p_h[1],...,p_h[n-1]]. Every entry must be an integer in the inclusive range shown above.
+For syntax only, a two-guest instance with n=3 could use <answer>[[0,1,2],[1,2,0]]</answer>.
 
