Implemented a native Track B perfect-matching packing generator based on the paper’s packing definition and multipartite framework ([full paper](https://arxiv.org/html/2001.03506)).

Key results:

- All local G1–G9(c) gates pass.
- Structure-aware guessing: 0/200,000.
- Four adversarial attacks: 0/8 successes each.
- Reference augmenting-path algorithm: 8/8, about 10,300 edge probes—correctly disclosed as Track B.
- Shipping answer: 611 characters, 230 elements, estimated 481 tokens.
- Determinism, JSON round-trip, compilation, profile schema, and transcript schema verified.

